  <FH_HelaSubhuman.label>海拉</FH_HelaSubhuman.label>
  <!-- EN: Hela's body has become a living command node for fleshbeasts. She can control a large fleshbeast group and automatically sustain its members with twisted flesh. Occupied parasite space reinforces every part of her body. -->
  <FH_HelaSubhuman.description>海拉的身体已经成为血肉兽的活体指挥节点。她可以控制大规模的血肉兽群，并自动用扭曲肉维持群组成员。被占用的寄生空间会强化她身体的每个部分。</FH_HelaSubhuman.description>
  
